  "question": {
    "text": "The centres of those circles which touch the circle, <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math> externally and also touch the <math><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></math> - axis, lie on"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "A hyperbola",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "A parabola",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "A circle",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "An ellipse which is not a circle",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given circle <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br />has centre <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math>.<br /><br />Let <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> be the centre of the circle which is touching the given circle externally<br /><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0139_46db0d901031.png\" style=\"width: 299px; height: 250px;\" /><br /><br />Then<br /><br /><math><msqrt><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math><math><msup><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math><math><msup><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> ,<br /><br />Replacing <math><mi>h</mi></math> by <math><mi>x</mi></math> and <math><mi>k</mi><mi>&#160;</mi></math> by <math><mi>y</mi></math>, locus is<br /><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br />Which is equation of parabola.</p>"
  }
}